Imveliso bhala: (['a:b:'] - [':']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['-'] - ['--']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ([''] - ['--']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['--'] - ['']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ([''] - ['']), umgca-omtsha.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: y, umgca-omtsha.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x buyisela: [''] nge: ['xx'].
Imveliso bhala: ((x iyafana: y) oku: ['OK'] okanye-oko: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), umgca-omtsha.